      "text": "WHO MAKES ART:  Artists\n        |\n        v\n  WHO ENABLES IT: Dealers (primary market) — first sale\n                  Auction houses (secondary market) — resale\n                  Galleries (display, relationship-building)\n                  Fairs (TEFAF, Art Basel, Frieze) — discovery\n                  Critics (discourse that creates value)\n                  Curators (institutional validation)\n        |\n        v\n  WHO BUYS:       Collectors (private)\n                  Museums (public and private, non-profit)\n                  Corporations (prestige holdings)\n                  Investors (financial return)\n        |\n        v\n  WHERE IT ENDS:  Museum (public, permanent)\n                  Private collection (may or may not be seen)\n                  Freeport storage (tax-advantaged never-seen)\n                  Auction (back to market)\n                  Donation (tax write-off)"
    },
