        "title": "11 - The Art Market",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "MECHANISM:\n  - Artist = craftsman in guild\n  - Contract specifies: subject, size, materials (especially\n    gold, ultramarine lapis lazuli -- the expensive ones\n    specified and paid for separately)\n  - Iconographic program set by patron/clergy\n  - Artist had limited input on subject or composition\n  - No signature, often; the guild guaranteed the work"
    },
