      },
      "text": "WORKSHOP SYSTEM:\n  Master → Journeymen → Apprentices\n  The master takes the commission; apprentices do\n  grounds, drapery backgrounds; master does faces,\n  hands, the critical sections\n  Training: 7-10 years before independent practice\n  This is exactly the senior-engineer mentorship model --\n  the journeyman years build skill before autonomy\n```"
    },
