      "text": "- **Cosimo de' Medici**: piety + political legitimacy through art (San Lorenzo,\n  San Marco library); de facto ruler through economic power, not title\n- **Lorenzo il Magnifico**: the artist as intellectual peer; Botticelli's mythological\n  subjects for private spaces (Neoplatonist programs, not religious)\n- **The papal court**: Julius II, Leo X — art as institutional power; the Vatican's\n  image under construction by the greatest artists of the generation"
